### E-Commerce API Tests
### Sử dụng với VS Code REST Client extension

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### 0. AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================

### Đăng ký Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Customer Test",
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "0901234567"
}

### Đăng nhập Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Đăng ký Admin (đổi role trong DB sau)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "admin123",
  "phone": "0909999999"
}

### Đăng nhập Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Lấy thông tin user hiện tại
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 1. CATEGORIES (Public GET, Staff/Admin CUD)
### ============================================

### Lấy tất cả Categories (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Tạo Category - Điện thoại (Staff/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Điện thoại",
  "description": "Smartphone các loại"
}

### Tạo Category - Laptop (Staff/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "description": "Máy tính xách tay"
}

### Tạo Category - Phụ kiện (Staff/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Phụ kiện",
  "description": "Phụ kiện điện tử"
}

### ============================================
### 2. PRODUCTS (Public GET, Staff/Admin CUD)
### ============================================

### Lấy tất cả Products (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Lấy Product theo ID (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### Tạo Product - iPhone (Staff/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "iPhone 15 Pro Max",
  "description": "Điện thoại Apple iPhone 15 Pro Max 256GB Titanium",
  "price": 34990000,
  "quantity": 50,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Tạo Product - Samsung (Staff/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra",
  "description": "Điện thoại Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra 512GB",
  "price": 31990000,
  "quantity": 30,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Tạo Product - MacBook (Staff/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "MacBook Pro M3 Pro",
  "description": "Laptop Apple MacBook Pro 14 inch M3 Pro chip 18GB RAM",
  "price": 49990000,
  "quantity": 20,
  "categoryId": 2
}

### Cập nhật Product (Staff/Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "iPhone 15 Pro Max - SALE",
  "price": 32990000
}

### Xóa Product (Staff/Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 3. SEARCH (Public)
### ============================================

### Health Check OpenSearch
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/health

### Tìm kiếm - keyword (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=iPhone

### Tìm kiếm - tiếng Việt (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=điện thoại

### Gợi ý tìm kiếm (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/suggest?q=iph

### Init Index (Staff/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search/init
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reindex tất cả products (Staff/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search/reindex
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 4. CACHE (Staff/Admin)
### ============================================

### Health Check Redis
GET {{baseUrl}}/cache/health

### Xem thống kê Cache (Staff/Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cache/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Xóa tất cả cache products (Staff/Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cache/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Xóa toàn bộ cache (Staff/Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cache/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 5. USER MANAGEMENT (Admin only)
### ============================================

### Lấy tất cả users (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lấy user theo ID (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tạo Staff account (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/staff
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Staff User",
  "email": "staff@test.com",
  "password": "staff123",
  "phone": "0908888888"
}

### Cập nhật user role (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "role": "staff"
}

### Deactivate user (Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 6. ORDERS
### ============================================

### Tạo đơn hàng (Customer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": "123 Nguyen Van Linh, Quan 7, TP HCM",
  "paymentMethod": "cod",
  "shippingFee": 30000,
  "tax": 0
}

### Lấy danh sách đơn hàng của tôi (Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lấy chi tiết đơn hàng (Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hủy đơn hàng (Customer)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "reason": "Đổi ý không muốn mua nữa"
}

### ============================================
### 7. VNPAY PAYMENT
### ============================================

### Tạo URL thanh toán VNPay (Customer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payment/vnpay/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orderId": 1
}

### Kiểm tra trạng thái thanh toán (Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payment/status/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 8. TEST FLOW
### ============================================

# 1. Đăng ký admin account
# 2. Vào MySQL đổi role thành 'admin'
# 3. Đăng nhập lấy token
# 4. Copy token vào @token ở trên
# 5. Tạo categories
# 6. Tạo products
# 7. Init search index
# 8. Test search
